  "description": "<p>Touch; inscribe a rune on a surface or object (the rune is visible, <strong>3ft</strong> across); choose one type.</p><ul><li>It triggers when read, touched or passed over (your choice); everything within a <strong>30ft radius</strong> is affected; <strong>Will negates</strong>.</li><li>Fear: <strong>Frightened</strong> <strong>1 minute</strong>.</li><li>Hopelessness: <strong>Incapacitated</strong> <strong>1 minute</strong>.</li><li>Insanity: attacks the nearest creature for <strong>1 minute</strong>.</li><li>Pain: <strong>Disadvantage</strong> on attacks and checks <strong>1 hour</strong>.</li><li>Sleep: <strong>Unconscious</strong> <strong>3 minutes</strong> (Level 8 or lower).</li><li>Stunning: <strong>Stunned</strong> <strong>1d6</strong> rounds.</li><li>Lasts until triggered or dispelled.</li><li>Material: powdered diamond and opal worth 5,000 gp, consumed.</li></ul><p class=\"arn-note\"><strong>Costly component:</strong> see Rare Spell Components in the Shopkeeper's Catalogue.</p><p class=\"arn-note\"><strong>Classes:</strong> Cleric, Illusionist</p>",
